graph TB
    subgraph 领域核心
        A[订单聚合]
        B[支付服务]
    end
    subgraph 防腐层
        C[PaymentGatewayACL]
        D[ShippingServiceACL]
        E[CrmCustomerACL]
    end
    subgraph 外部系统
        F[Stripe API]
        G[顺丰 API]
